<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Murray &amp; Roberts buys road surfacing firm.</title>
<headline>Murray &amp; Roberts buys road surfacing firm.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Murray &amp; Roberts Contractors announced on Monday it had acquired Engen Ltd's road surfacing arm, Vialit- Rand Road Tech.</p>
<p>The acquisition would be housed in Colas, Murray and Roberts' road surfacing subsidiary.</p>
<p>Murray and Roberts said the purchase was in line with its strategy of enhancing its core business.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
